[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909701591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106775#issuecomment-2909701591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106775","id":2909701591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tboXX","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T13:08:39Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T13:08:39Z","body":"What are the specific cases that this is needed for?\r\n\r\nAre classes that use `GDSOFTCLASS()` still descending from `Object`?\r\n\r\nMy original impression, was that `GDSOFTCLASS()` was for classes that _didn't_ descend from `Object`, but some of the things this PR moves into `GDSOFTCLASS()` are overrides of virtual methods from `Object`, for example, `_getv()`, `_setv()`, `_validate_propertyv()`, etc","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909701591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909713781","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106775#issuecomment-2909713781","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106775","id":2909713781,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tbrV1","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T13:13:02Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T13:13:57Z","body":"> What are the specific cases that this is needed for?\r\n> \r\n> Are classes that use `GDSOFTCLASS()` still descending from `Object`?\r\n> \r\n> My original impression, was that `GDSOFTCLASS()` was for classes that _didn't_ descend from `Object`, but some of the things this PR moves into `GDSOFTCLASS()` are overrides of virtual methods from `Object`, for example, `_getv()`, `_setv()`, `_validate_propertyv()`, etc\r\n\r\n`GDSOFTCLASS` is meant to be used for all classes that derive from `Object`. `GDCLASS` uses `GDSOFTCLASS` internally, and additionally adds functionality for the class and possibly methods being bound through the GDExtension / scripting interface.\r\n\r\nThere's also some minimal  documentation in the code for it now:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ce20f49cd40f8ff61bd7503e25144bc49b60428e/core/object/object.h#L398-L399\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909713781/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909861833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106775#issuecomment-2909861833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106775","id":2909861833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tcPfJ","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T14:02:13Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T14:02:13Z","body":"Ok, thanks, that makes sense! For some reason I had it in my head that `GDSOFTCLASS()` was also intended to allow `Object::cast_to<T>()` to work for non-`Object` derived classes, which would have issues with those overridden virtual methods","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909861833/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2910228497","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106775#issuecomment-2910228497","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106775","id":2910228497,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tdpAR","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T16:30:49Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T16:30:49Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2910228497/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]